    val a = 5;
  end
  structure N = struct
    val b = 10
    val a = E.a + b
  end
  structure D = struct
    val d = E.a + N.a
  end
end
```
- N is compiled using `sigma_0 + sigma_2`.
- D is compiled using `sigma_0 + sigma_2 + sigma_4`.
- The result is also `{M \u21a0 sigma_7}`.

Each class/structure has its own symbol table.

